abstract_en:
During the research first stage, the Terms of Reference for the draft DBN development to supersede DBN V.2.3-7- 
 2010 "Transport structures. Metros" were elaborated and agreed. These TOR present the reasons for the draft DBN 
 development, the development time-frame, purpose and tasks for draft DBN; normalization object characteristics; 
 chapters and main provisions to be set forth by the draft DBN; its interrelations with other normative documents; 
 information sources; work stages and their execution periods, as well as some supplementary data concerning the 
 procedures for the draft DBN consideration and approval.

